# Links across the two epics
#
# A retelling isn't sameness, the telling can change. MAN-26 adds 'the innocent man' that SIL-23 d
# oesn't state.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m19_crosstext> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Links across the two epics" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:P67_refers_to

iy:Retelling a owl:Class .
iy:FormulaEcho a owl:Class .
iy:StoryEcho a owl:Class .

iy:retells a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:sharesWording a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:mirrors a owl:ObjectProperty .
